            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " meter of ribbon is used to make 8 badges. What is the length of the ribbon used for each badge? (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8 \\times \\frac{1}{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 } \\div \\frac { 1 } { 8 }"
            },
